supposed to mean?

212
00:11:01,461 --> 00:11:03,931
Well, I only meant that, uh,

213
00:11:03,931 --> 00:11:05,699
while I'm sure
there are many men

214
00:11:05,699 --> 00:11:07,801
who'd be thrilled
to find themselves in bed

215
00:11:07,801 --> 00:11:10,704
